# Jobs

The UI never calls the ticker over HTTP. It writes Firestore and listens. The server never exposes domain REST (`/pago/login`, `/tenants/propose`, …). It only runs ticker jobs on `STEP_STATUS` (`PENDING` → `COMPLETED` / `FAILED`). `/health` is the only HTTP route.

- Client mutator: set `*Status: PENDING`, `*Error: null`, `wakeTicker()`, listen until not pending
- Ticker: `list` / filter pending, do the work, write the result onto the same doc
- Wait for a result with `onSnapshot` on that doc, not `fetch` / `axios`

```js
// no
await axios.post("/ticker/pago/login", values)
await axios.post("/ticker/create_tenants", { createdBy })

// yes
await service.update(id, { loginStatus: STEP_STATUS.PENDING, loginError: null })
void wakeTicker()
```
